message: "If you use this instrument or its method, please cite it."
title: "film-frame-measurement: a validated instrument for measuring the visual form of film, animation and video frame corpora"
abstract: >-
  A six-stage procedure and toolkit for building a measurement instrument over a
  corpus of screen images: frame-accurate still extraction from pinned editions,
  seventeen computed colour, texture and composition descriptors validated against
  constructed images with known answers, a two-factor visual-tension index, a human
  coding scheme with simulation-sized inter-coder reliability, and clustered-data
  statistics with restricted permutation. Built for animation, where the
  live-action-derived cinemetric toolkit does not transfer unmodified.
